# Head union tail pruning (isr_tail) with maximal sets: an empty tail
# always prunes, an empty prefix never; otherwise the projection on the
# tail items decides. The two tails at one level (for prefix {3}) are a
# misuse that the port reproduces literally: the first projection prunes
# item 3 from the parent tree, so the repository no longer sees {4,3,2,1}.
items 5
total 10
target maximal
supp 1 max
size 1 max
output emit
setup
tail 4 3 2 1 0
add 4 6
tail 3 2 1
add 3 5
add 2 4
add 1 3
report
remove 1
report
remove 1
report
remove 1
add 2 5
tail
tail 1
report
remove 1
report
remove 1
add 3 6
tail 2 1
tail 1
add 2 5
tail 1
report
remove 1
report
remove 1
report
